    "Name": "Helios",
    "Details": "Designed to support Assault Mechs such as the Victor and the Emperor, the 60 ton Helios is a St. Ives Compact design that entered production in 3058. Powered by a 240-rated Fusion Core and built on an Endo Steel chassis, the Helios HEL-3D is armed with a Gauss Rifle. Paired ER Medium Lasers and SRM-6’s make for a potent combo should anyone try to close range.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
